    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Market Research",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert business researcher specializing in SaaS tools and bootstrapped business operations.\n\n## Task\nCompile a comprehensive, curated list of free online tools suited to solopreneurs and bootstrapped businesses. Research available options, evaluate their key features and pricing models, and organize the findings into a structured comparison table.\n\n## Context\nBusiness context: {{business-context}}\n\nFocus on tools that offer genuine free tiers (not just trials), prioritize ease of use, and deliver immediate value to resource-conscious entrepreneurs. Evaluate tools based on their reliability, feature completeness in free plans, and scalability.\n\n## Output\nPresent your findings as a markdown table with three columns:\n\n| Tool Name | Key Features | Pricing |\n|-----------|--------------|----------|\n\nInclude 8-12 highly relevant tools. For each:\n- **Tool Name**: Official product name with category in parentheses\n- **Key Features**: 3-5 most valuable capabilities, emphasizing what's available in the free tier\n- **Pricing**: Free tier limits, paid tier starting price if applicable, note if free forever vs. limited trial\n\nOrder tools by relevance to the stated business context. Add a brief 2-3 sentence summary above the table explaining your selection criteria.",
