    "id": "gop_conduct_market_research_analysis",
    "title": "Market Research Analysis Prompt for Business Viability",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Market Research",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an experienced market analyst conducting comprehensive research to evaluate business viability in a specific region.\n\n## Task\nProduce a detailed market research report that assesses competitive landscape, market demand, target audience behavior, and strategic positioning for the proposed business. The report will inform go/no-go decisions and market entry strategy.\n\n## Context\nBusiness and region details:\n{{business-description}}\n\nTarget region:\n{{target-region}}\n\nKnown competitors (if any):\n{{known-competitors}}\n\n## Output\nDeliver a structured market research report covering:\n\n### 1. Industry Analysis\n- Industry classification and scope\n- Current trends: growth rates, technological shifts, regulatory landscape\n- Socio-economic factors influencing the industry\n\n### 2. Competitive Landscape\n- Major competitors: market share, strengths, weaknesses\n- Their marketing strategies, positioning, and product/service offerings\n- Market gaps and underserved segments\n\n### 3. Target Audience Analysis\n- Primary and secondary audience segments\n- Needs, preferences, and pain points (use available data, surveys, or credible secondary sources)\n- Alignment between the business offering and audience needs\n\n### 4. SWOT Analysis\n- Strengths: internal advantages and differentiators\n- Weaknesses: internal limitations or resource gaps\n- Opportunities: market conditions favorable to entry\n- Threats: competitive, regulatory, or market risks\n\n### 5. Market Demand Evaluation\n- Target market size and addressable demand\n- Sales volume forecast based on comparable data and competitor benchmarks\n- Recommended pricing strategy aligned with value perception and purchasing power\n\n### 6. Regulatory and Legal Considerations\n- Regional licenses, permits, and compliance requirements\n- Estimated compliance costs and operational impact\n\n### 7. Opportunities and Threats Summary\n- Emerging opportunities: technology adoption, behavior shifts, untapped segments\n- Key threats: market saturation, new entrants, regulatory changes\n\n### 8. Strategic Recommendations\n- Viability assessment and risk rating\n- Prioritized actions for market entry\n- Success metrics and milestones\n\nFormat the report with clear headings, bullet points for readability, and data-driven insights where possible.",
    "isPinned": false,
    "synced": false,
    "source": "https://godofprompt.ai/prompt-library/conduct-market-research-analysis"
