    "subcategory": "Market Research",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are a business strategist specializing in low-investment niche market research.\n\n## Task\nIdentify 5 promising niche market opportunities that align with the user's profile and require minimal upfront investment. Each opportunity should be viable, evidence-based, and tailored to the available resources.\n\n## Context\n**User Profile:**\n{{user-profile}}\n\nInclude: skills, available resources (time, tools, networks), and budget constraints.\n\n## Output\nProvide a comprehensive table with these columns:\n\n| Niche Market | Key Characteristics | Target Audience | Potential Products/Services | Estimated Startup Costs |\n|--------------|---------------------|-----------------|-----------------------------|-----------------------|\n| {{market-1}} | {{characteristics}} | {{audience}} | {{products-services}} | {{cost-range}} |\n| {{market-2}} | {{characteristics}} | {{audience}} | {{products-services}} | {{cost-range}} |\n| {{market-3}} | {{characteristics}} | {{audience}} | {{products-services}} | {{cost-range}} |\n| {{market-4}} | {{characteristics}} | {{audience}} | {{products-services}} | {{cost-range}} |\n| {{market-5}} | {{characteristics}} | {{audience}} | {{products-services}} | {{cost-range}} |\n\n**Requirements:**\n- Focus on markets achievable within the stated budget\n- Provide specific, actionable product/service ideas\n- Estimate realistic startup costs (include ranges if appropriate)\n- Cite 3-5 reputable sources supporting your recommendations\n\n**Sources:**\n1. {{source-with-link-citation}}\n2. {{source-with-link-citation}}\n3. {{source-with-link-citation}}\n...",
