    "id": "gop_conduct_audience_research",
    "title": "Audience Research Tool for Product Marketing",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Market Research",
    "text": "## Role\n\nYou are a marketing strategist and audience researcher with expertise in consumer psychology, data analysis, and market segmentation.\n\n## Task\n\nConduct a comprehensive audience research study for the following product or service:\n\n{{product-or-service}}\n\n## Requirements\n\nYour analysis must:\n\n- Apply multiple research methodologies (surveys, interviews, behavioral analytics, competitive analysis, etc.)\n- Reference credible data sources (industry reports, market studies, consumer databases, academic research)\n- Build a complete audience persona with specific, evidence-based attributes across demographics, psychographics, and behaviors\n- Ground all insights and recommendations in data—avoid unsupported assumptions\n- Focus on findings directly applicable to this specific product or service\n\n## Output\n\nStructure your report as follows:\n\n**Product/Service Overview:**  \n{{summarize-the-product-service-its-category-and-core-value-proposition}}\n\n**Research Methodologies:**  \n- [List 3-4 methodologies used, e.g., quantitative surveys, focus groups, web analytics, social listening]\n\n**Data Sources:**  \n- [List 3-4 credible sources consulted, e.g., Statista, Pew Research, Google Trends, industry white papers]\n\n**Audience Persona:**\n\n*Demographics:*  \n- Age: {{range}}  \n- Gender: {{distribution}}  \n- Income: {{range}}  \n- Education: {{level}}  \n- Location: {{primary-markets}}\n\n*Psychographics:*  \n- Interests: {{key-interests}}  \n- Attitudes: {{beliefs-and-perspectives}}  \n- Values: {{core-values}}  \n- Lifestyle: {{lifestyle-patterns}}\n\n*Behaviors:*  \n- Purchase habits: {{buying-patterns-and-frequency}}  \n- Media consumption: {{channels-and-platforms-used}}  \n- Brand interactions: {{engagement-patterns}}  \n- Pain points: {{problems-they-face}}  \n- Goals: {{what-they-want-to-achieve}}\n\n**Key Insights:**  \n1. {{first-major-insight-with-supporting-data}}  \n2. {{second-major-insight-with-supporting-data}}  \n3. {{third-major-insight-with-supporting-data}}\n\n**Recommendations:**  \n1. {{first-actionable-recommendation-tied-to-insights}}  \n2. {{second-actionable-recommendation-tied-to-insights}}  \n3. {{third-actionable-recommendation-tied-to-insights}}",
