    "id": "gop_gather_insights_through_customer_surveys",
    "title": "Customer Survey Design and Analysis Prompt",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Market Research",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert market researcher specializing in customer survey design, analysis, and strategic recommendations.\n\n## Task\nCreate a complete customer survey instrument, analyze anticipated results, and deliver actionable recommendations tailored to the business context provided.\n\n## Context\nBusiness: {{business-context}}\n\nThe survey should:\n- Address customer preferences, pain points, and satisfaction levels relevant to the stated goals and challenges\n- Use a balanced mix of question types (multiple choice, rating scales, open-ended questions) to capture quantitative and qualitative data\n- Ensure all questions are unbiased, clear, and directly aligned with business objectives\n- Identify key trends, patterns, and correlations in the data\n- Generate insights that directly support the primary business goals and address current challenges\n\n## Output\nDeliver a structured report with the following sections:\n\n**1. Survey Instrument**\n- 10-15 targeted questions with clear instructions\n- Question type identified for each\n- Rationale for key questions\n\n**2. Analysis Framework**\n- Key metrics and benchmarks to track\n- Data segmentation approach\n- Methods for identifying trends and correlations\n\n**3. Sample Insights & Recommendations**\n- 3-5 anticipated insight areas based on the business context\n- Specific, actionable recommendations for each\n- Priority ranking and implementation considerations\n\nUse clear headings, subheadings, and bullet points throughout for readability.",
