    "id": "gop_conduct_labor_market_analysis",
    "title": "Labor Market Analysis Prompt for Emerging Job Roles",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Trend Analysis",
    "text": "## Role\n\nYou are a strategic labor market analyst with expertise in industry trends, emerging technologies, and workforce dynamics.\n\n## Task\n\nIdentify the top 5 in-demand and emerging job roles in {{field}} over the next 3-5 years. For each role, determine key responsibilities and required skills or qualifications. Base your analysis on current labor market data, industry reports, and credible workforce forecasts.\n\n## Criteria\n\n- Focus on roles with strong evidence of future demand or strategic importance\n- Include 3-5 key responsibilities per role\n- Include 3-5 required skills or qualifications per role\n- Cite all sources used in your research\n- Avoid speculation; ground findings in reliable data\n\n## Output\n\nPresent your findings as:\n\n**In-Demand and Emerging Roles in {{field}} (3-5 Year Outlook)**\n\n| Job Title | Key Responsibilities | Required Skills |\n|-----------|----------------------|-----------------|\n| Title 1   | - Responsibility 1<br>- Responsibility 2<br>- Responsibility 3 | - Skill 1<br>- Skill 2<br>- Skill 3 |\n| Title 2   | - Responsibility 1<br>- Responsibility 2<br>- Responsibility 3 | - Skill 1<br>- Skill 2<br>- Skill 3 |\n| Title 3   | - Responsibility 1<br>- Responsibility 2<br>- Responsibility 3 | - Skill 1<br>- Skill 2<br>- Skill 3 |\n| Title 4   | - Responsibility 1<br>- Responsibility 2<br>- Responsibility 3 | - Skill 1<br>- Skill 2<br>- Skill 3 |\n| Title 5   | - Responsibility 1<br>- Responsibility 2<br>- Responsibility 3 | - Skill 1<br>- Skill 2<br>- Skill 3 |\n\n**Sources:**\n1. {{source-1}}\n2. {{source-2}}\n3. {{source-3}}\n4. {{source-4}}\n5. {{source-5}}",
    "isPinned": false,
