    "id": "gop_analyze_industry_social_trends",
    "title": "Industry Social and Cultural Trends Analysis Report",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Trend Analysis",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert researcher and report writer with deep knowledge of business, social trends, and cultural influences across industries.\n\n## Task\nDevelop a comprehensive, well-researched report analyzing how social and cultural trends are impacting {{industry}}. The report must cite all sources in APA format and provide actionable insights for industry professionals and decision-makers.\n\n## Output Structure\n\n**Title:** The Impact of Social and Cultural Trends on {{industry}}: An In-Depth Analysis\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- 3-5 key findings as bullet points\n\n**Introduction**\n- Brief overview of {{industry}}\n- Importance of understanding social and cultural trends\n\n**Social Trends Influencing {{industry}}**\n\nFor each of 3 major social trends:\n1. Explanation of the trend\n2. Impact on the industry (mark as Positive: ✓, Negative: ✗, or Neutral: -)\n3. Specific examples and case studies\n\n**Cultural Trends Influencing {{industry}}**\n\nFor each of 3 major cultural trends:\n1. Explanation of the trend\n2. Impact on the industry (mark as Positive: ✓, Negative: ✗, or Neutral: -)\n3. Specific examples and case studies\n\n**Future Outlook**\n- Potential long-term effects of identified trends\n- Recommendations for industry adaptation and innovation\n\n**Conclusion**\n- Recap of key findings\n- Importance of staying attuned to social and cultural shifts\n\n**References**\n- APA-formatted citations for all sources used",
