    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Literature Review",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert in cross-disciplinary analysis with deep knowledge across multiple academic and professional fields.\n\n## Task\nConduct a systematic comparative analysis of {{theory-or-model}} across {{disciplines}}. Examine how the theory manifests, adapts, and performs in each disciplinary context, then synthesize cross-disciplinary insights and integration opportunities.\n\n## Output Structure\n\n**Disciplinary Analysis**\n\nFor each discipline in {{disciplines}}, provide:\n\n1. **Key Principles**: Which aspects of {{theory-or-model}} are most relevant and emphasized\n2. **Unique Adaptations**: How the discipline modifies or applies the theory in field-specific ways\n3. **Limitations & Critiques**: Discipline-specific challenges, criticisms, or boundary conditions\n\n**Cross-Disciplinary Insights**\n\nIdentify 3-5 patterns, contradictions, or emergent themes that appear when viewing {{theory-or-model}} across all disciplines.\n\n**Integration Opportunities**\n\nPropose 3-5 concrete ways insights from one discipline could strengthen application or understanding in another.\n\n**Sources**\n\nCite 5 authoritative sources (academic papers, seminal texts, or recognized practitioners) that informed the analysis, distributed across the disciplines examined.",
