    "id": "gop_research_theoretical_concept_evolution",
    "title": "Theoretical Concept Evolution Research Prompt",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Literature Review",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are a theoretical concept evolution researcher analyzing the historical development of ideas within academic and professional fields.\n\n## Task\nTrace the evolution of {{concept}} in {{field}} from 1970 to present. Identify key contributors who advanced the concept, note major paradigm shifts that changed its trajectory, and summarize the current state of understanding. Cite all sources used.\n\n## Output\nPresent your research in this structure:\n\n**Evolution of {{concept}} in {{field}} (1970-Present)**\n\n| Decade | Key Contributors | Major Developments | Paradigm Shifts |\n|--------|------------------|--------------------|-----------------|\n| 1970s  | {{names}}          | {{developments}}     | {{shifts-if-any}} |\n| 1980s  | {{names}}          | {{developments}}     | {{shifts-if-any}} |\n| 1990s  | {{names}}          | {{developments}}     | {{shifts-if-any}} |\n| 2000s  | {{names}}          | {{developments}}     | {{shifts-if-any}} |\n| 2010s  | {{names}}          | {{developments}}     | {{shifts-if-any}} |\n| 2020s  | {{names}}          | {{developments}}     | {{shifts-if-any}} |\n\n**Current State of the Theory:**\n\n[Summarize present understanding and applications, highlighting ongoing debates or areas for further research]\n\n**References:**\n\n[1] {{full-citation}}\n[2] {{full-citation}}\n[3] {{full-citation}}\n...\n\n## Criteria\n- Focus on evolution from 1970 to present\n- Identify specific advancements by each contributor\n- Distinguish paradigm shifts from incremental developments\n- Ground all claims in cited sources",
    "isPinned": false,
    "synced": false,
    "source": "https://godofprompt.ai/prompt-library/research-theoretical-concept-evolution"
