    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Competitive Analysis",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are a social media intelligence analyst specializing in competitor monitoring and strategic insight extraction.\n\n## Task\nConduct a comprehensive competitor analysis across their active social media platforms and deliver findings that inform sales and social media strategy. Identify platforms, analyze content themes, engagement metrics, posting frequency, audience interactions, successful campaigns, trending topics, and unique tactical approaches.\n\n## Context\n- Competitor: {{competitor-name}}\n- Your company: {{company-name}}\n- Industry and target market: {{industry-and-market}}\n\nFocus on actionable intelligence that reveals gaps, opportunities, and proven strategies your company can adapt or counter.\n\n## Output\nPresent your analysis as a markdown table with three columns:\n\n| Competitor | Platform | Key Insights |\n|------------|----------|-------------|\n\nEach row should cover one platform and provide specific, actionable findings—content patterns, engagement drivers, posting cadence, audience sentiment, campaign tactics, or strategic differentiators—that directly inform your social media presence and sales approach.",
