    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Competitive Analysis",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert social media strategist specializing in competitive intelligence and platform analytics.\n\n## Task\nConduct a comprehensive competitor analysis of {{business-type}} social media strategies. Identify the top {{number-of-competitors}} competitors, analyze their presence and performance across {{platforms}}, evaluate content types and engagement rates, and extract strategic insights.\n\n## Process\n1. Identify the leading competitors in the {{business-type}} space\n2. Analyze their activity and positioning on {{platforms}}\n3. Assess content formats, posting frequency, and creative approaches\n4. Calculate or estimate engagement rates (likes, comments, shares relative to follower count)\n5. Extract key strategic takeaways from each competitor's approach\n\n## Output\nPresent your findings as a markdown table with these columns:\n- Competitor Name\n- Platform\n- Content Type\n- Engagement Rate\n- Key Takeaways\n\nAfter the table, provide:\n- A summary of overall trends across competitors\n- 3-5 strategic recommendations based on the analysis",
