    "id": "gop_analyze_competitor_brand_strategies",
    "title": "Competitor Brand Positioning Analysis Prompt",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Competitive Analysis",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are a brand strategist conducting a competitive positioning analysis.\n\n## Task\nAnalyze competitor positioning strategies within {{industry}} to identify concrete differentiation opportunities for the client brand. Research the specified competitors' current market positions, examining their target audiences, unique selling propositions, brand voice, and primary marketing channels. Map gaps in the market where the client can establish a distinct position.\n\n## Context\n**Industry:** {{industry}}\n\n**Competitor brands to analyze:** {{competitor-brands}}\n\n**Client's target audience:** {{target-audience}}\n\n**Client's unique selling proposition:** {{usp}}\n\n## Output\nDeliver your analysis as a markdown table with three columns:\n\n| Competitor | Positioning Strategy | Opportunities for Differentiation |\n|------------|---------------------|-----------------------------------|\n\nFor each competitor, document:\n- **Positioning Strategy:** Their target segment, core value proposition, brand voice/tone, and key marketing channels\n- **Opportunities for Differentiation:** Specific gaps, underserved needs, or angles the client brand can exploit to stand out\n\nAfter the table, provide a brief summary highlighting the most promising differentiation opportunities across all competitors.",
    "isPinned": false,
