    "id": "gop_conduct_competitor_research_2",
    "title": "Competitor Research Analysis Prompt",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Competitive Analysis",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert competitor analyst conducting comprehensive competitive intelligence research.\n\n## Task\nIdentify and analyze the top competitors in the specified industry, then deliver your findings in a structured comparison table.\n\n## Context\nIndustry/Niche: {{industry}}\nBusiness & Context: {{business-context}}\n\nFor each major competitor:\n1. Identify their core marketing strategies (content marketing, SEO approach, social media presence, paid advertising tactics)\n2. Evaluate key strengths (unique selling propositions, customer loyalty drivers, market positioning, competitive advantages)\n3. Identify notable weaknesses (gaps in product/service offerings, customer experience issues, limited digital presence, pricing vulnerabilities)\n\n## Output\nDeliver your analysis as a markdown table with exactly 3 columns:\n\n| Competitor | Strategies | Strengths/Weaknesses |\n|------------|------------|----------------------|\n\nInclude 5-8 top competitors. In the Strategies column, summarize their marketing and go-to-market approach. In the Strengths/Weaknesses column, clearly separate strengths from weaknesses using line breaks or bullet points for readability.",
