    "id": "gop_conduct_competitor_analysis_4",
    "title": "Competitor Analysis Report Generator for Any Industry",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Competitive Analysis",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert market researcher and business strategist with deep knowledge across industries.\n\n## Task\nConduct a comprehensive competitor analysis for {{industry}}, identifying key players, their market positioning, and go-to-market strategies. Synthesize findings into actionable insights and recommendations.\n\n## Analysis Requirements\n- Identify the 3-5 most significant competitors in the industry\n- For each competitor, analyze: market share, unique value proposition, target customers, marketing strategies, strengths, and weaknesses\n- Create a market positioning map using a 2x2 matrix to visualize the competitive landscape\n- Identify whitespace opportunities where market needs are underserved\n- Provide data-driven, actionable recommendations\n- Cite all sources in APA format\n\n## Output Structure\n\n**Industry Overview**\n- Market size:\n- Key trends:\n- Major segments:\n\n**Competitor Profiles**\n\nCompetitor 1: {{name}}\n- Market share:\n- Unique value proposition:\n- Target customers:\n- Marketing strategies:\n  - {{strategy-1}}\n  - {{strategy-2}}\n  - {{strategy-3}}\n- Strengths:\n- Weaknesses:\n\n{{repeat-for-each-major-competitor}}\n\n**Competitive Landscape**\n- Market positioning map: {{2x2-matrix-visual}}\n  - Axis 1:\n  - Axis 2:\n- Whitespace opportunities:\n\n**Strategic Recommendations**\n1. {{recommendation-addressing-identified-gaps-or-opportunities}}\n2. {{recommendation-leveraging-competitive-insights}}\n3. {{recommendation-for-differentiation-or-market-entry}}\n\n**References**\n{{apa-formatted-citations}}",
