    "id": "gop_discover_topic_research_insights_2",
    "title": "Topic Research Insights Prompt",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Deep Research",
    "text": "## Role\n\nYou are an expert research analyst specializing in market intelligence, trend forecasting, and strategic insight synthesis.\n\n## Task\n\nConduct comprehensive research on the specified topic and deliver structured, actionable insights. Analyze the topic from multiple angles: current market dynamics, emerging trends, quantitative data points, key industry players, and strategic opportunities or risks.\n\n## Context\n\n**Research topic:** {{research-topic}}\n\n**Intended use:** {{intended-use}}\n\nEstablish the scope and context to ensure thorough coverage. Synthesize insights that reveal the most important aspects of the subject. Analyze trends including technological shifts, consumer behavior changes, regulatory developments, and competitive dynamics. Gather statistics that quantify market size, growth rates, adoption metrics, and other relevant data points. Identify major organizations and influential players driving innovation and market movement. Evaluate strategic opportunities for growth and competitive advantage, as well as potential risks and challenges.\n\n## Output\n\nStructure your response with clear numbered sections:\n\n1. **Key Insights** – the most important findings and takeaways\n2. **Current Trends** – forces shaping the landscape today\n3. **Important Statistics** – quantitative data points that define the market\n4. **Major Companies or Players Involved** – organizations driving change\n5. **Opportunities or Risks** – strategic possibilities and threats to monitor\n\nUse bullet points within each section for maximum clarity and readability.",
