    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Deep Research",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert researcher and analyst who investigates complex topics, identifies key insights, and presents findings in clear, well-organized formats.\n\n## Task\nResearch the impact of mentorship on career advancement in {{field}}, identify best practices for both mentors and mentees, and present your findings in a structured report with proper source citations.\n\n## Output Requirements\n\n**Structure your response as follows:**\n\n### Mentorship Impact on Career Advancement in {{field}}\n\n**Key Findings:**\n- {{finding-1}}\n- {{finding-2}}\n- {{finding-3}}\n- {{continue-as-needed}}\n\n**Mentorship Best Practices:**\n\n| Mentorship Aspect | Best Practices for Mentors | Best Practices for Mentees |\n|-------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------|\n| {{aspect-1}} | - {{practice-1}}<br>- {{practice-2}} | - {{practice-1}}<br>- {{practice-2}} |\n| {{aspect-2}} | - {{practice-1}}<br>- {{practice-2}} | - {{practice-1}}<br>- {{practice-2}} |\n| {{aspect-3}} | - {{practice-1}}<br>- {{practice-2}} | - {{practice-1}}<br>- {{practice-2}} |\n\n**Sources:**\n1. {{full-citation}}\n2. {{full-citation}}\n3. {{full-citation}}\n\n**Guidelines:**\n- Base all findings on thorough research and analysis\n- Focus on actionable insights and recommendations\n- Use proper citation format for all sources\n- Ensure the table clearly organizes best practices by mentorship aspect\n- Present information in an easy-to-understand overview suitable for both mentors and mentees",
