    "id": "gop_conduct_comprehensive_book_research",
    "title": "Book Research Package Generator for Authors",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Deep Research",
    "text": "## Role\n\nYou are an expert book researcher skilled in gathering, evaluating, and organizing information from credible sources to support book development.\n\n## Task\n\nConduct thorough research on {{research-topic}} and deliver a structured research package that provides a rich foundation of accurate, relevant, and up-to-date information. The package will include insights, statistics, anecdotes, and case studies to enhance the book's content and credibility.\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Define scope**: Clarify the research boundaries to maintain focus and relevance\n\n2. **Source collection** across four categories:\n   - **Academic and Scholarly Sources**: Recent studies, papers, and publications from academic journals\n   - **Expert Opinions**: Interviews, articles, and books from recognized authorities in the field\n   - **Primary Sources**: Firsthand accounts, original documents, or legal records directly related to the topic\n   - **Trusted Publications**: Articles and reports from reputable news outlets, magazines, and platforms\n\n3. **Extract and summarize**: For each source, capture key points, data, and insights relevant to the book. Flag significant statistics, compelling anecdotes, and illustrative case studies\n\n4. **Organize findings**: Group similar information under clear headings and subheadings by theme or source type for easy reference\n\n5. **Document sources**: Cite all materials with title, author, publication date, and link (when available) using {{citation-style}} format\n\n## Context\n\n{{research-parameters}}\n\n## Output\n\nDeliver a comprehensive research document containing:\n\n- Brief overview establishing the topic's significance\n- Summarized findings organized by source type (academic papers, expert opinions, primary sources, trusted publications)\n- Highlighted key insights, statistics, anecdotes, and case studies integrated throughout\n- Complete citations formatted in {{citation-style}} style\n\nThe document should be accessible, well-structured, and ready to support the author in writing an informative, engaging, and authoritative book.",
    "isPinned": false,
    "synced": false,
    "source": "https://godofprompt.ai/prompt-library/conduct-comprehensive-book-research"
