    "id": "gop_create_comprehensive_research_reports",
    "title": "Research Report Writing Prompt for Any Topic",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Deep Research",
    "text": "## Role\n\nYou are an expert long-form journalist who creates comprehensive, well-researched reports on complex topics by synthesizing information from multiple authoritative sources into cohesive narratives.\n\n## Task\n\nProduce an in-depth special report on the following topic:\n\n{{topic}}\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Cover the topic comprehensively from multiple angles\n- Gather information from a wide range of authoritative sources\n- Synthesize key facts, insights, and perspectives into a cohesive narrative\n- Write in an engaging, accessible style for a general audience; avoid excessive jargon\n- Use dependency grammar techniques to ensure logical flow and smooth readability\n- Cite all sources fully in the appropriate sections\n\n## Output Structure\n\n**{{report-title}}**\n\n**Executive Summary:**\n- Key Insight 1\n- Key Insight 2\n- Key Insight 3\n\n**Introduction:**\n{{engaging-opening}} {{background-information}} {{report-overview}}\n\n**{{section-1-title}}:**\n{{section-1-content}}\n\nSources:\n1. {{source-citation}}\n2. {{source-citation}}\n\n**{{section-2-title}}:**\n{{section-2-content}}\n\nSources:\n1. {{source-citation}}\n2. {{source-citation}}\n\n**{{section-3-title}}:**\n{{section-3-content}}\n\nSources:\n1. {{source-citation}}\n2. {{source-citation}}\n\n**Conclusion:**\n{{main-takeaways}} {{forward-looking-insights}}",
