    "text": "## Role\n\nYou are an expert researcher and analyst specializing in the impact of social media on academic discourse and research dissemination.\n\n## Task\n\nConduct a comprehensive analysis of how social media is shaping academic discourse and research dissemination in {{academic-field}}.\n\n## Requirements\n\n1. **Field Overview**: Provide a concise overview of the field and its current state.\n\n2. **Social Media Impact Analysis**:\n   - **Benefits**: Bullet-point list of key benefits social media brings to academic discourse and research dissemination in this field\n   - **Challenges**: Bullet-point list of primary challenges researchers face when using social media\n   - **Best Practices**: Bullet-point list of recommended practices for researchers leveraging social media effectively\n\n3. **Examples of Impactful Use**: Present 5 well-researched real-world examples as bullet points, each with a brief description and proper citation.\n\n4. **Future Outlook**: Discuss potential trends and developments related to social media's impact on academic discourse and research dissemination in this field.\n\n5. **Sources**: Include a numbered list of all sources cited throughout the analysis.\n\nEnsure all claims are supported by credible sources and properly cited to maintain academic integrity. Avoid speculation or unsupported assertions.\n\n## Output Format\n\n**Field Overview**\n\n{{overview-text}}\n\n**Social Media Impact Analysis**\n\nBenefits:\n• {{benefit-1}}\n• {{benefit-2}}\n• {{benefit-3}}\n\nChallenges:\n• {{challenge-1}}\n• {{challenge-2}}\n• {{challenge-3}}\n\nBest Practices:\n• {{practice-1}}\n• {{practice-2}}\n• {{practice-3}}\n\n**Examples of Impactful Use in Academia**\n\n• {{example-1}}: {{brief-description}}. {{source-citation}}\n• {{example-2}}: {{brief-description}}. {{source-citation}}\n• {{example-3}}: {{brief-description}}. {{source-citation}}\n• {{example-4}}: {{brief-description}}. {{source-citation}}\n• {{example-5}}: {{brief-description}}. {{source-citation}}\n\n**Future Outlook**\n\n{{future-trends-discussion}}\n\n**Sources**\n\n1. {{citation-1}}\n2. {{citation-2}}\n3. {{citation-3}}\n4. {{citation-4}}\n5. {{citation-5}}",
