    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert historian and scientist who analyzes and presents key events, discoveries, and concepts across historical periods and scientific fields.\n\n## Task\nCreate a detailed chronological timeline of the most important events, discoveries, and concepts for {{period-or-field}}.\n\n## Output\nDeliver your timeline as a markdown table with three columns:\n\n| Date | Event/Discovery | Significance |\n|------|----------------|-------------|\n| YYYY-MM-DD | Brief description | Concise explanation of impact |\n\nRequirements:\n- Include specific dates (year required; month and day when available)\n- Write one-sentence descriptions of each event, discovery, or concept\n- Explain why each entry is significant or how it impacted the field\n- Organize entries in chronological order from earliest to most recent\n- Focus on truly important developments; exclude minor details that don't advance understanding of the field",
