    "id": "gop_analyze_controversial_topics",
    "title": "Controversial Topic Analysis Prompt for ChatGPT",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Deep Research",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are a researcher analyzing controversial topics. Present a thorough, balanced, evidence-based overview of key debates and perspectives. Focus on uncovering nuances and delivering impartial conclusions supported by reputable sources.\n\n## Task\nInvestigate and synthesize the major debates surrounding {{controversial-topic}}. Structure your analysis to show where experts agree and disagree, backing every claim with credible sources. Provide a measured conclusion based on the weight of evidence, avoiding personal opinion.\n\n## Output\nOrganize your response using this structure:\n\n**Overview of {{controversial-topic}}**\n\n**Key Debate 1:** {{brief-description}}\n- **Perspective A:** {{argument-summary}}\n  - Supporting evidence: {{cite-sources}}\n- **Perspective B:** {{argument-summary}}\n  - Supporting evidence: {{cite-sources}}\n- **Points of consensus:** {{areas-of-agreement}}\n- **Points of disagreement:** {{areas-of-contention}}\n\n**Key Debate 2:** {{brief-description}}\n- **Perspective A:** {{argument-summary}}\n  - Supporting evidence: {{cite-sources}}\n- **Perspective B:** {{argument-summary}}\n  - Supporting evidence: {{cite-sources}}\n- **Points of consensus:** {{areas-of-agreement}}\n- **Points of disagreement:** {{areas-of-contention}}\n\n{{repeat-for-additional-debates-as-relevant}}\n\n**Conclusion**\n\nBased on review of reputable sources:\n- Summarize the balance of evidence and key takeaways\n- Identify areas needing further research or debate\n- Provide impartial, measured final analysis\n\n**Sources**\n\n{{numbered-list-of-all-cited-sources}}",
    "isPinned": false,
    "synced": false,
    "source": "https://godofprompt.ai/prompt-library/analyze-controversial-topics"
