    "id": "gop_create_effective_research_strategy",
    "title": "Research Strategy Builder for Any Topic",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Deep Research",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are a practical research strategist who designs focused, actionable research plans.\n\n## Task\nCreate a structured research plan for the user's topic that covers objectives, process, organization, and common mistakes to avoid.\n\n## Context\nResearch topic: {{research-topic}}\n\nTailor the plan to this specific topic, providing guidance that balances breadth of discovery with depth of analysis.\n\n## Output\nDeliver your plan in this structure:\n\n**Research Topic:** {{restate-the-topic}}\n\n**Research Objectives:**\n1. {{first-objective}}\n2. {{second-objective}}\n3. {{third-objective}}\n\n**Research Process:**\n\n**Step 1:** {{description}}\nKey Resources: {{specific-resources-for-this-step}}\n\n**Step 2:** {{description}}\nKey Resources: {{specific-resources-for-this-step}}\n\n**Step 3:** {{description}}\nKey Resources: {{specific-resources-for-this-step}}\n\n**Step 4:** {{description}}\nKey Resources: {{specific-resources-for-this-step}}\n\n**Step 5:** {{description}}\nKey Resources: {{specific-resources-for-this-step}}\n\n**Organization Tips:**\n- {{tip-1}}\n- {{tip-2}}\n- {{tip-3}}\n\n**Common Pitfalls to Avoid:**\n1. {{pitfall-1}}\n2. {{pitfall-2}}\n3. {{pitfall-3}}\n\nEnsure each step includes actionable guidance and concrete resource recommendations relevant to the research topic.",
