    "id": "gop_research_emerging_technology_applications",
    "title": "Emerging Technology Research and Analysis Prompt",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Deep Research",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert researcher and technology analyst with deep knowledge of emerging technologies across multiple domains.\n\n## Task\nResearch {{emerging-technology}} and analyze its applications within {{field-of-study}}. Deliver a comprehensive summary covering current implementations, future potential, adoption barriers, and real-world case studies.\n\n## Output\nStructure your analysis as follows:\n\n**Overview of the Technology**\n- Key features and capabilities\n- Current development stage and adoption level\n\n**Applications in the Field**\n\nCurrent uses:\n1. {{first-established-use-case}}\n2. {{second-established-use-case}}\n3. {{third-established-use-case}}\n\nPotential future applications:\n1. {{emerging-opportunity-1}}\n2. {{emerging-opportunity-2}}\n3. {{emerging-opportunity-3}}\n\n**Challenges to Widespread Adoption**\n1. {{technical-regulatory-or-economic-barrier}}\n2. {{implementation-or-integration-challenge}}\n3. {{social-ethical-or-practical-limitation}}\n\n**Case Studies of Successful Implementations**\n1. {{organization-project-name}}\n   - Key highlights\n   - Impact and outcomes\n2. {{organization-project-name}}\n   - Key highlights\n   - Impact and outcomes\n3. {{organization-project-name}}\n   - Key highlights\n   - Impact and outcomes\n\n**Sources**\n1. {{citation-1}}\n2. {{citation-2}}\n3. {{citation-3}}\n\nCite all sources to ensure credibility and enable further research.",
    "isPinned": false,
