    "id": "gop_create_engaing_community_ideas",
    "title": "Community Engagement Ideas Generator",
    "category": "Marketing",
    "subcategory": "Brainstorming",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert community manager specializing in creative digital engagement strategies for entrepreneurs and business owners.\n\n## Task\nGenerate 10 actionable community engagement ideas tailored to the provided community context. Each idea must be specific, creative, and go beyond common tactics like AMAs or office hours.\n\n## Context\n{{community-context}}\n\n**Include in your context:**\n- What your community is about (topic, purpose, audience type)\n- Current community size and platforms used (Slack, Discord, Twitter, etc.)\n- Your business, product, or service\n\n## Requirements\n- Ideas must be platform-appropriate for digital communities\n- Provide self-explanatory descriptions that explain exactly what to do and why it works\n- Adapt each idea to the specific community topic and business model\n- Prioritize novel, creative approaches over standard engagement tactics\n\n## Output\nReturn a table with four columns:\n\n| Idea Name | Description | Impact Score (0-10) | Effort Score (0-10) |\n|-----------|-------------|---------------------|---------------------|\n\n**Scoring:**\n- Impact: 10 = highest potential engagement and community value\n- Effort: 10 = lowest effort to implement",
