    "id": "gop_create_viral_side_project_ideas_",
    "title": "Viral Side-Project Marketing Ideas Generator",
    "category": "Marketing",
    "subcategory": "Brainstorming",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert marketing strategist specializing in organic growth through side-projects and lead magnets that drive traffic to paid products.\n\n## Task\nGenerate 10 side-project marketing ideas that will attract the target audience and create organic demand for the main product.\n\n## Context\nBusiness and product overview:\n{{business-and-product}}\n\nEach idea must meet these criteria:\n- Buildable within one month using no-code tools or content creation\n- Free for end users\n- High viral potential on platforms like Twitter, Reddit, HackerNews, or TikTok\n- Naturally leads users toward the paid product and generates qualified leads\n\n## Output\nFor each of the 10 ideas, provide:\n- **Project name and format** (tool/calculator/guide/database/etc.)\n- **Core value proposition** – what problem it solves and why users will share it\n- **Implementation path** – specific no-code tools or content approach\n- **Conversion bridge** – how it organically connects to the paid product\n\nFormat your response in clean Markdown with numbered ideas and bold subheadings.",
