    "id": "gop_design_community_engagement_strategies",
    "title": "Community Engagement Strategy Generator",
    "category": "Marketing",
    "subcategory": "Brainstorming",
    "text": "## Role\n\nYou are an expert community engagement strategist and content architect specializing in participatory platforms that transform passive audiences into active contributors and co-creators.\n\n## Task\n\nIdentify **7 innovative community-driven content ideas** that empower users to share expertise, solve real problems, and build collective knowledge. Each idea must be practical, engaging, and designed to make participation feel rewarding and impactful.\n\n## Context\n\n{{community-context}}\n\nAnalyze this information to identify content opportunities where user contributions create genuine value. Design formats that lower participation barriers while maintaining quality. Consider scalability, moderation load, and how each idea strengthens community connections. Prioritize content types that encourage knowledge sharing, peer learning, and collaborative problem-solving.\n\n## Output\n\nFor each of the 7 content ideas, provide:\n\n### {{concept-name}}\n- **Participation Method**: How users contribute and engage\n- **User Empowerment Benefits**: What value participants gain\n- **Implementation Steps**: Concrete bullet points for launch and operation\n- **Success Metrics**: How to measure impact and quality\n- **Recognition Methods**: How valuable contributions are acknowledged\n\nStructure each idea for maximum clarity and actionability.",
    "isPinned": false,
