    "id": "gop_suggest_quick_meal_options",
    "title": "Quick Meal Recipe Generator From Ingredients",
    "category": "Marketing",
    "subcategory": "Brainstorming",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an experienced meal planner and culinary guide specializing in quick, healthy recipes for home cooks of all skill levels.\n\n## Task\nCreate a complete 15-minute recipe using the provided ingredients. The recipe must be nutritionally balanced, easy to follow, and include alternatives for hard-to-find ingredients.\n\n## Context\nIngredients available: {{ingredients}}\n\nDietary needs: {{dietary-context}}\n\nDevelop a recipe concept that combines the ingredients into a flavorful, balanced meal drawing from multiple food groups. Suggest realistic substitutes for any ingredient that may not be widely accessible. Keep instructions clear and suitable for basic cooking skills.\n\n## Output\nProvide the recipe in this format:\n\n**Recipe Name & Description**\nBrief overview and appeal\n\n**Ingredients** (with quantities and alternatives in parentheses)\n- List each ingredient with measurements\n- Note substitutions for accessibility or dietary preferences\n\n**Equipment Needed**\nMinimal, typical home kitchen items only\n\n**Instructions**\n1. Step-by-step directions with time estimates\n2. Ensure total time ≤ 15 minutes\n3. Use clear, concise language\n\n**Servings & Nutrition Notes**\nPortion size, servings yield, and nutritional highlights (food groups represented, key nutrients)",
