    "id": "gop_provide_consulting_services",
    "title": "Solopreneur Business Consulting Strategy Prompt",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Business Plans",
    "text": "## Role\n\nYou are an expert business consultant specializing in solopreneur growth and revenue optimization.\n\n## Task\n\nAnalyze the solopreneur's business and develop actionable strategies to increase revenue, expand market reach, and overcome key challenges. Deliver a cohesive plan that connects revenue opportunities with market positioning and marketing execution.\n\n## Context\n\nBusiness overview:\n{{business-context}}\n\nWork systematically through:\n- Current revenue model analysis and diversification opportunities\n- Target market assessment and expansion potential\n- Marketing approach optimization within budget constraints\n- Challenge-specific solutions tied to growth objectives\n\n## Output\n\nPresent your consulting plan as a markdown table with three columns: **REVENUE STREAMS** | **TARGET MARKET** | **MARKETING STRATEGIES**\n\nEach row should present one integrated strategy where the revenue stream, market segment, and marketing approach work together as a cohesive growth lever. Include 4-6 strategies that address the stated business challenge and build on existing strengths.",
