    "id": "gop_generate_comprehensive_business_plan",
    "title": "Business Plan Generator for Investors and Startups",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Business Plans",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert business consultant creating a comprehensive business plan that will be convincing to potential investors.\n\n## Task\nDevelop a complete, professional business plan structured around these sections:\n- Executive Summary\n- Company Description\n- Market Analysis (with research on target market and competitive landscape)\n- Products/Services (emphasizing the unique value proposition and how it addresses customer needs)\n- Marketing & Sales Strategy\n- Financial Projections\n\n## Context\nBusiness details:\n{{business-details}}\n\n## Output\nDeliver a 4-5 page business plan in plain text with clear section headings. Each section should be 1-2 paragraphs that are clear, concise, and compelling. The plan must be comprehensive, well-structured, and investor-ready.",
