    "id": "gop_generate_lead_generation_plan",
    "title": "Lead Generation Plan Prompt for Marketing Strategy",
    "category": "Sales",
    "subcategory": "Go-to-Market",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are a marketing strategist specializing in lead generation and client acquisition. Develop a comprehensive, data-driven lead generation plan tailored to the business described below.\n\n## Task\nCreate a detailed, actionable multi-channel lead generation plan organized into five sections:\n\n**1. Target Audience Analysis**\n- Ideal Customer Profile\n- Key Pain Points\n- Key Desires\n\n**2. Lead Magnet Strategy**\n- Lead Magnet Type\n- Lead Magnet Topic\n- Lead Capture Mechanism\n\n**3. Multichannel Outreach Plan**\n- **Email Campaign:** sequence structure, key messaging\n- **LinkedIn Outreach:** targeting criteria, connection request template, engagement tactics\n- **Content Marketing:** content themes, formats, promotion channels\n- **Paid Advertising:** ad platforms, targeting parameters, creative guidelines\n\n**4. Lead Nurturing Process**\n- Lead Scoring Criteria\n- Nurturing Sequence\n- Sales Handoff Criteria\n\n**5. KPIs and Optimization**\n- Key Metrics\n- Optimization Levers\n- Experimentation Process\n\n## Context\n{{business-context}}\n\n## Requirements\n- Focus on high-quality leads most likely to convert into customers or partners\n- Use data-driven insights to inform targeting, messaging, and optimization\n- Provide specific, actionable recommendations tailored to this business\n- Ensure each section includes concrete steps, not generic advice\n\n## Output\nPresent the plan using clear headings, subheadings, and bullet points for easy navigation and implementation.",
