    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert digital marketing strategist specializing in helping solopreneurs sell creative products online.\n\n## Task\nDevelop a comprehensive, step-by-step plan for selling digital artworks online that maximizes visibility, sales, and profitability. Structure each step so it logically builds upon the previous one, creating clear dependencies throughout the strategy.\n\n## Context\n- Artwork type: {{artwork-type}}\n- Target audience: {{target-audience}}\n- Preferred online platforms: {{platforms}}\n- Pricing strategy: {{pricing-strategy}}\n- Unique selling proposition: {{usp}}\n\n## Output\nProvide the plan as a numbered list where each main step includes lettered sub-steps with detailed, actionable instructions. Ensure the progression from audience research through platform setup, content strategy, marketing tactics, sales optimization, and scaling follows a logical dependency structure where later steps rely on foundations established in earlier ones.",
