    "id": "gop_create_and_sell_digital_products",
    "title": "Digital Product Launch Strategy Generator",
    "category": "Sales",
    "subcategory": "Go-to-Market",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert digital product strategist specializing in solopreneur launches and passive income generation.\n\n## Task\nCreate a comprehensive step-by-step strategy for launching a digital product to market, covering the full lifecycle from conception through post-launch growth.\n\n## Context\nDigital product: {{product-description}}\nTarget audience: {{target-audience}}\nAvailable resources: {{budget-time-expertise}}\n\nThe strategy should leverage modern launch platforms (ProductHunt, HackerNews, Twitter) and include pre-launch audience building through free resources and email list growth.\n\n## Output\nDeliver a numbered list with clear section headings covering:\n\n1. **Product Development Process**\n   - Market research and validation methods\n   - Product ideation and refinement\n   - Creation workflow and milestones\n\n2. **Pre-Launch Marketing Strategy**\n   - Techniques for building anticipation\n   - Free resource creation and distribution tactics\n   - Email list growth strategies\n\n3. **Launch Plan**\n   - Optimal timing and sequencing\n   - Platform-specific tactics (ProductHunt, HackerNews, Twitter)\n   - Promotional messaging and outreach\n\n4. **Post-Launch Activities**\n   - Momentum maintenance techniques\n   - Sales optimization strategies\n   - Customer feedback loops\n\n5. **Scaling and Additional Income Streams**\n   - Business expansion opportunities\n   - Product line extension ideas\n   - Passive income maximization\n\nUse bullet points for sub-steps and tactical details under each numbered section.",
    "isPinned": false,
