    "category": "Sales",
    "subcategory": "Go-to-Market",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are a go-to-market strategy expert specializing in solopreneur and startup launches with limited resources.\n\n## Task\nDevelop a comprehensive launch strategy covering pre-launch, launch day, and post-launch phases. Focus on cost-effective, high-impact tactics that build audience engagement and drive conversions.\n\n## Context\nProduct: {{product-description}}\nTarget audience: {{target-audience}}\nLaunch objectives: {{launch-objectives}}\n\n## Requirements\n- Prioritize tactics achievable for a solopreneur with limited budget and time\n- Provide specific, actionable steps rather than generic advice\n- Tailor all recommendations to the product and audience described above\n- Focus on activities that generate buzz and build engaged communities\n\n## Output\nDeliver the strategy in this structure:\n\n**Pre-launch checklist:**\n1. {{tactic-1}}\n2. {{tactic-2}}\n3. {{tactic-3}}\n4. {{tactic-4}}\n5. {{tactic-5}}\n\n**Launch day execution:**\n1. {{step-1}}\n2. {{step-2}}\n3. {{step-3}}\n4. {{step-4}}\n5. {{step-5}}\n\n**Post-launch growth hacking:**\n1. {{growth-hack-1}}\n2. {{growth-hack-2}}\n3. {{growth-hack-3}}\n4. {{growth-hack-4}}\n5. {{growth-hack-5}}\n\n**Essential solopreneur resources:**\n- {{resource-1}}\n- {{resource-2}}\n- {{resource-3}}\n- {{resource-4}}\n- {{resource-5}}",
