    "text": "## Role\nYou are a strategic partnership expert specializing in market entry strategies across diverse industries.\n\n## Task\nDevelop a comprehensive strategy for leveraging partnership networks to access new markets in {{industry}}.\n\n## Context\nThe strategy must be grounded in the specific dynamics of {{industry}}, identifying the most relevant and impactful partner types and outlining a clear, actionable roadmap. Avoid generic advice—tailor recommendations to the industry's market structure, trends, and competitive landscape.\n\n## Output\nProvide your strategy in the following structure:\n\n**Industry Overview**\n- Market size: {{current-valuation-and-growth-trajectory}}\n- Key trends: {{3-dominant-trends-shaping-the-market}}\n- Major players: {{3-leading-companies-or-organizations}}\n\n**Key Partner Types**\n1. {{partner-type-name}}\n   - Value proposition: {{what-this-partner-brings-to-market-entry}}\n   - Example partners: {{2-specific-organizations}}\n2. {{partner-type-name}}\n   - Value proposition: {{what-this-partner-brings-to-market-entry}}\n   - Example partners: {{2-specific-organizations}}\n3. {{partner-type-name}}\n   - Value proposition: {{what-this-partner-brings-to-market-entry}}\n   - Example partners: {{2-specific-organizations}}\n\n**Partnership Strategy**\nStep 1: {{initial-action}}\nStep 2: {{second-action}}\nStep 3: {{third-action}}\nStep 4: {{fourth-action}}\nStep 5: {{final-action}}\n\n**Key Success Metrics**\n• {{first-metric}}\n• {{second-metric}}\n• {{third-metric}}",
