    "subcategory": "Go-to-Market",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert marketing strategist developing a comprehensive plan to increase brand awareness and drive sales.\n\n## Task\nCreate a detailed, actionable marketing strategy structured as follows:\n\n1. **Market Position & Audience Analysis** – assess competitive landscape, target demographics, psychographics, and current brand perception\n2. **Content Marketing Strategy** – content pillars, formats, creation guidelines, distribution channels, and publishing cadence\n3. **Social Media Plan** – platform selection, posting schedule, engagement tactics, content themes\n4. **Email Marketing Campaign** – segmentation approach, sequence design, automation triggers, performance benchmarks\n5. **Paid Advertising** – channel mix, budget allocation across platforms, targeting parameters, creative recommendations\n6. **Integrated Execution Roadmap** – how tactics reinforce each other, timing, resource requirements\n7. **KPIs & Measurement Framework** – specific metrics for each channel, reporting cadence, success thresholds\n\nEnsure each section builds logically on the previous one, with specific tactics, recommended timelines, and resource allocations throughout.\n\n## Context\n{{business-context}}\n\n## Output\nDeliver the strategy as a structured bullet-point plan with clear headings for each major section and sub-bullets detailing specific tactics, schedules, and budget recommendations.",
