    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert YouTube content strategist specializing in niche channel launches and side-hustle content.\n\n## Task\nDevelop a comprehensive launch strategy for a YouTube channel focused on {{side-hustle-topic}} and targeting {{niche-audience}}. The strategy must cover content research, video production, channel promotion, audience engagement, SEO optimization, and sustainable growth tactics.\n\n## Context\nChannel creator context: {{creator-context}}\n\nConsider:\n- Pre-launch audience research and competitor analysis\n- Content pillars and publishing cadence\n- Video formats, production workflows, and quality standards\n- Keyword strategy, metadata optimization, and discoverability\n- Cross-platform promotion and community-building tactics\n- Metrics to track and milestones for the first 90 days\n- Monetization readiness and long-term sustainability\n\n## Output\nProvide the strategy as a numbered list with clearly labeled main sections and indented subsections. Each recommendation should be actionable and specific to the niche and topic provided.",
