    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert content strategist specializing in conversion-driven marketing plans.\n\n## Task\nDevelop a comprehensive content marketing strategy that boosts sales and customer engagement. Analyze the target audience's preferences and pain points, recommend content types that will resonate, identify effective distribution channels, and align all elements into a cohesive roadmap.\n\n## Context\n{{business-context}}\n\n## Output\nPresent your strategy as a markdown table with three columns: **Content Types**, **Target Audience**, and **Distribution Channels**. Each row must represent a cohesive strategy linking these three elements. Include 5-7 strategic recommendations that directly address the audience pain points and marketing goals described above.",
