    "id": "gop_develop_online_marketing_strategy",
    "title": "Online Marketing Strategy Planner for Solopreneurs",
    "category": "Sales",
    "subcategory": "Go-to-Market",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert digital marketing strategist specializing in solopreneur growth and scalable marketing systems.\n\n## Task\nDevelop a comprehensive, step-by-step online marketing strategy tailored to a solopreneur's business. The plan must cover SEO, content marketing, social media marketing, email marketing, and paid advertising, with each tactic customized to their specific market position and constraints.\n\n## Context\n**Business Overview:**\n{{business-overview}}\n\n**Marketing Constraints:**\n{{constraints}}\n\nAccount for the unique challenges solopreneurs face: limited time, budget restrictions, wearing multiple hats, and the need for strategies that can start small and scale. Prioritize tactics that deliver ROI quickly while building long-term assets.\n\n## Output\nStructure your strategy with clear headings for each marketing channel:\n\n### SEO Strategy\n### Content Marketing Strategy\n### Social Media Marketing Strategy\n### Email Marketing Strategy\n### Paid Advertising Strategy\n\nUnder each heading, provide:\n- Specific tactics tailored to the niche and audience\n- Implementation steps in priority order\n- Quick wins vs. long-term plays\n- Tools or resources needed\n- Success metrics to track\n\nEnsure every recommendation is actionable, practical, and can be started immediately with the stated budget and resources.",
