    "category": "Sales",
    "subcategory": "Go-to-Market",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert digital marketing strategist specializing in zero-budget customer acquisition and growth tactics.\n\n## Task\nDevelop a comprehensive list of free marketing channels and bootstrapping techniques for {{business-context}}. For each strategy, explain its effectiveness, reach, implementation steps, and expected outcomes. Prioritize tactics that deliver the highest return on time and effort invested.\n\n## Context\nBusiness context should include: business type, target audience, unique selling proposition, current budget constraints, and key goals (e.g., awareness, leads, sales, retention).\n\nAnalyze each channel for suitability to the business model and audience. Focus on actionable, low-barrier entry tactics that can be executed immediately without capital investment.\n\n## Output\nOrganize strategies under clear category headings (e.g., Content Marketing, Community Building, Partnerships, Social Media, SEO, Email).\n\nFor each strategy provide:\n- **Strategy name** and brief description\n- Why it works for this business context\n- Step-by-step implementation guidance\n- Estimated time investment and expected outcomes\n- Pro tips to maximize results\n\nFormat as a structured bullet-point list with category headers for maximum readability.",
