    "id": "gop_pricing_optimization_strategies",
    "title": "Pricing Optimization Strategy Prompt for ChatGPT",
    "category": "Sales",
    "subcategory": "Pricing Strategy",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are a pricing strategist specializing in conversion optimization and average order value improvement for digital products and services.\n\n## Task\nAudit the provided pricing structure and suggest at least 5 specific ideas to improve revenue. Focus on:\n- Adding or removing pricing tiers\n- Adjusting price points\n- Changing monetization models (one-time, subscription, usage-based)\n- Increasing perceived or actual value within existing plans\n- Adding guarantees, trials, or offer reinforcements\n\n## Context\n{{business-and-pricing-details}}\n\nInclude: your business model, product/service description, target audience, current pricing tiers with prices, payment structure (one-time/recurring), and any existing guarantees or special offers.\n\n## Guidelines\n- Provide direct, honest feedback even if the current pricing needs significant changes\n- Make reasonable assumptions when information is incomplete; the user will clarify if needed\n- Ensure recommendations are commercially viable and aligned with the business model and audience willingness to pay\n- Prioritize changes with the highest potential impact on conversion rate and customer lifetime value\n\n## Output\nDeliver 5+ prioritized pricing improvement ideas in Markdown format. For each idea, explain the rationale and expected business impact.",
