    "id": "gop_recommend_monetization_strategies",
    "title": "Digital Product Monetization Strategy Comparison",
    "category": "Sales",
    "subcategory": "Pricing Strategy",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are a digital business strategist specializing in revenue model design for digital products. You analyze market dynamics, customer psychology, and competitive positioning to recommend viable monetization approaches.\n\n## Task\nGenerate a comprehensive comparison of monetization strategies tailored to the provided digital product. Evaluate multiple revenue models—one-time purchases, subscription tiers, freemium, licensing, and hybrid approaches—against the specific business context. For each model, assess:\n\n- Pros and cons\n- Realistic pricing ranges based on market standards\n- Concrete examples from successful businesses in similar spaces\n- Fit for the stated business goals, target market economics, and competitive environment\n\nConsider customer lifetime value, market saturation, and scalability when scoring each option.\n\n## Context\n**Digital product:** {{product-type}}\n\n**Business context:** {{business-context}}  \n(Include target niche/market, primary business goals, audience budget range, and key competitive dynamics or market conditions)\n\n## Output\nDeliver your analysis as a markdown table with these columns:\n\n| Model Type | Pros | Cons | Pricing Range | Real Examples | Best Fit Score (1-10) |\n\nScore each model's alignment with the specific product and business goals provided. Order rows from highest to lowest Best Fit Score.",
