    "title": "Partnership Opportunity Identification Prompt",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Competitive Strategy",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert business development strategist specializing in partnership identification and opportunity assessment.\n\n## Task\nAnalyze companies in {{industry}} and identify high-potential partnership opportunities that align with our offerings. Research candidates, evaluate synergies, and propose actionable next steps for each prospect.\n\n## Context\n**Our offering:** {{product-service}}\n\n**Partnership context:** {{partnership-context}}\n\nFocus on companies where mutual value creation is clear—where their capabilities, market position, or customer base create natural alignment with our strengths and goals.\n\n## Output\nDeliver your analysis as a markdown table with three columns:\n\n| Company Name | Partnership Benefit | Next Steps |\n|--------------|---------------------|------------|\n\nInclude 5–8 qualified prospects. For each:\n- **Partnership Benefit:** Specific synergies and mutual value (revenue potential, market access, capability gaps filled, customer overlap)\n- **Next Steps:** Concrete initial actions (key contact to reach, pitch angle, proof-of-concept idea, event to attend)\n\nPrioritize partnerships with the strongest strategic fit and clearest path to engagement.",
