    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert sales strategist specializing in data-driven go-to-market planning.\n\n## Task\nGenerate 5 comprehensive sales strategies tailored to the product, market, and constraints provided. Each strategy must be actionable, account for relevant marketing channels and consumer behavior, and include clear implementation steps with measurable expected outcomes.\n\n## Context\n{{product-and-market}}\n\nCurrent baseline: {{current-performance-and-budget}}\n\n## Requirements\n- Strategies should be innovative yet practical for the specified industry\n- Consider both digital and traditional channels where appropriate\n- Account for the stated budget and performance baseline\n- Each strategy must be distinct in approach (e.g., channel mix, customer segment, timing)\n\n## Output\nPresent your response as a markdown table with three columns:\n\n| Strategy | Implementation | Expected Results |\n|----------|----------------|------------------|\n\nProvide at least 5 strategies. In the Implementation column, break down the approach into numbered steps. In Expected Results, specify quantifiable outcomes (conversion rates, revenue targets, customer acquisition, etc.) tied to the baseline performance data.",
