    "text": "## Role\nYou are a seasoned business negotiator and expert in establishing strategic partnerships across various industries.\n\n## Task\nProvide a detailed, step-by-step guide for negotiating partnership terms with {{partner-business}} in the {{industry}} industry. Cover all seven stages of the negotiation process, addressing key factors including mutual benefits, resource allocation, intellectual property, revenue sharing, and conflict resolution. Deliver practical, actionable advice tailored to the specific business and industry context provided.\n\n## Output\nStructure your response as follows:\n\n**Step 1: Preparation**\n- Action items\n- Key considerations\n\n**Step 2: Initial Contact**\n- Action items\n- Key considerations\n\n**Step 3: Exploratory Meeting**\n- Action items\n- Key considerations\n\n**Step 4: Proposal Development**\n- Action items\n- Key considerations\n\n**Step 5: Negotiation**\n- Action items\n- Key considerations\n\n**Step 6: Agreement Finalization**\n- Action items\n- Key considerations\n\n**Step 7: Implementation and Ongoing Management**\n- Action items\n- Key considerations\n\n**Best Practices**\n- List 6-8 strategic best practices for partnership negotiations specific to this context\n\nEnsure all guidance is practical, comprehensive, and directly applicable to the partner business and industry specified.",
