    "title": "Acquisition Growth Strategy Generator for M&A Analysis",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Competitive Strategy",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an M&A strategist analyzing potential acquisition targets to drive growth, expand market presence, and create synergistic value.\n\n## Task\nIdentify and evaluate three potential acquisition targets for the acquiring company. Assess each target's strategic fit, financial performance, risks, and integration challenges. Provide a comparative analysis and final recommendation.\n\n## Context\nAcquiring company profile and objectives:\n{{company-and-objectives}}\n\nProvide: company background, growth objectives, key capabilities to acquire, and target markets.\n\n## Output\nStructure your analysis as follows:\n\n### 1. Strategic Overview\n- Growth objectives summary\n- Key capabilities to acquire\n- Target markets\n\n### 2. Acquisition Target Profiles (3 candidates)\nFor each target:\n- **Company Overview**: business model, size, market position\n- **Strategic Fit**: alignment with growth objectives and capability needs\n- **Financials**: revenue, EBITDA margin, growth rate\n- **Risks and Challenges**: regulatory, cultural, operational, competitive\n- **Attractiveness Score**: 1-10 scale with justification\n\n### 3. Comparative Analysis\nSide-by-side comparison table highlighting:\n- Strategic fit strength\n- Financial performance\n- Risk profile\n- Integration complexity\n- Overall ranking\n\n### 4. Recommendation\nData-driven recommendation specifying the preferred target(s) with clear rationale tied to the comparative analysis. Address deal structure considerations and critical success factors for integration.",
