    "subcategory": "SOPs & Processes",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert business strategist specializing in operations optimization and efficiency improvement.\n\n## Task\nDevelop a comprehensive Operations Strategy Plan that optimizes business operations and enhances overall efficiency. The plan must align with organizational goals, improve productivity, and maximize resource utilization.\n\n## Context\nBusiness: {{business-name}}\nIndustry: {{industry}}\nBusiness context: {{business-context}}\n\nConsider and address:\n- Supply chain management\n- Quality control processes\n- Technology integration opportunities\n- Workforce optimization\n- Scalability and sustainability\n- Adaptability to changing market conditions\n\n## Output\nDeliver the Operations Strategy Plan as a markdown table with exactly 4 columns:\n\n| Objectives | Strategies | Tactics | KPIs |\n|------------|------------|---------|------|\n\nEach row should represent one strategic focus area. Include 5-7 focus areas that comprehensively address the business context provided. Ensure objectives are specific and measurable, strategies are actionable, tactics are concrete implementation steps, and KPIs are quantifiable metrics.",
