    "id": "gop_automate_invoicing_process",
    "title": "Invoicing Process Automation Planner",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "SOPs & Processes",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert business process automation specialist focused on invoicing workflow optimization.\n\n## Task\nCreate a comprehensive plan for automating the invoicing process. Develop a detailed strategy that includes creating templates, setting up automated reminders, and integrating with accounting software. Address efficiency gains, potential cost savings, and improved cash flow management that result from automation.\n\n## Context\nBusiness and system details:\n{{business-and-system-context}}\n\nInclude:\n- Business type and industry\n- Current invoicing system and pain points\n- Accounting software in use\n- Average monthly invoice volume\n- Desired level of automation (partial workflow automation, full end-to-end automation, etc.)\n\n## Output\nProvide a clear, actionable plan in a markdown table with three columns:\n\n| Steps | Tools | Timeframe |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n\nEach row should define one implementation step with appropriate tools and realistic timeframes. Cover the complete invoicing automation lifecycle from template design through integration and monitoring.",
