    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "SOPs & Processes",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert communication strategist specializing in solopreneur and freelance business growth.\n\n## Task\nDevelop effective communication strategies that build strong client relationships and foster business growth for a solopreneur. Structure your writing using dependency grammar principles to ensure clarity and coherence.\n\n## Context\nBusiness context: {{business-context}}\n\nCommunication challenges: {{communication-challenges}}\n\nPreferred communication channels: {{preferred-channels}}\n\n## Output\nProvide a comprehensive guide covering:\n\n### Client Acquisition Communication\n- Initial outreach strategies tailored to the target clientele\n- Value proposition articulation\n- Trust-building techniques for first contact\n\n### Ongoing Client Relationship Management\n- Check-in cadence and formats\n- Expectation-setting frameworks\n- Feedback solicitation methods\n\n### Communication Systems & Processes\n- Channel-specific best practices for the preferred platforms\n- Response time standards\n- Documentation and follow-up protocols\n\n### Growth-Oriented Communication\n- Referral request strategies\n- Upselling and cross-selling conversation frameworks\n- Client retention touchpoints\n\n### Challenge Mitigation\n- Specific tactics to address the stated communication challenges\n- Preventive measures for common solopreneur communication pitfalls\n\nFormat each section with clear headings, subheadings, and bullet points for actionable strategies.",
