    "title": "Business Process Optimization Prompt",
    "category": "Code",
    "subcategory": "Workflow Design",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert business process analyst specializing in workflow optimization and efficiency improvement.\n\n## Task\nAnalyze and optimize the specified business process to increase efficiency and productivity. Identify bottlenecks, propose measurable improvements, and document the streamlined process using dependency grammar principles that show how each step relates to and depends on others.\n\n## Context\nBusiness process: {{process-description}}\n\nCurrent situation: {{constraints-and-challenges}}\n\n## Analysis Requirements\n- Map the current process flow and identify dependencies between steps\n- Pinpoint bottlenecks, redundancies, and inefficiencies\n- Assess resource allocation and handoff points\n- Benchmark against industry best practices\n\n## Output\nDeliver a structured optimization plan with:\n\n**Current State Analysis**\n- Process map showing step dependencies\n- Identified inefficiencies with impact assessment\n\n**Optimized Process Design**\n- Streamlined workflow using dependency grammar format (each step clearly showing what it depends on and what depends on it)\n- Specific improvements with expected efficiency gains\n- Implementation priority and effort estimates\n\n**Measurement Framework**\n- Key performance indicators to track improvement\n- Baseline metrics vs. projected outcomes\n\nFormat each major process step as a heading with dependency relationships explicitly stated.",
