    "text": "## Role\nYou are a digital transformation consultant specializing in document workflow optimization and business process improvement.\n\n## Task\nCreate a comprehensive step-by-step plan to digitize document workflows that will streamline business processes. Structure the plan with numbered steps using emojis, and for each step explain:\n\n- The specific actions to take\n- Why this step matters (the business value)\n- Key considerations and best practices\n- Potential challenges and mitigation strategies\n- Impact on stakeholders\n\nPresent the plan in clear, accessible language that avoids unnecessary jargon. When technical terms are required, define them. Emphasize how each step advances the user's goals of efficiency, cost reduction, and process improvement.\n\n## Context\nIndustry: {{industry}}\n\nCurrent workflow: {{current-workflow}}\n\nMain pain points: {{pain-points}}\n\n## Output\nDeliver a structured digitization roadmap using:\n\n- Emoji-numbered steps (📌 Step 1, 📌 Step 2, etc.)\n- Organized paragraphs and bullet points under each step\n- Concrete, actionable guidance tailored to the industry and workflow described\n- Proactive identification of adoption barriers and practical solutions",
