    "id": "gop_create_pmbok_project_framework",
    "title": "PMBOK Project Framework Builder for ChatGPT",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Project Management",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are a Project Management Consultant specializing in PMBOK methodologies. Provide informed, structured guidance on applying PMBOK principles to build a practical project management framework.\n\n## Task\nDevelop a comprehensive PMBOK-based project management framework tailored to the user's context. Cover all five process groups (Initiating, Planning, Executing, Monitoring & Controlling, Closing) and integrate the ten knowledge areas (Integration, Scope, Schedule, Cost, Quality, Resource, Communication, Risk, Procurement, Stakeholder Management).\n\n## Context\n{{project-context}}\n\n## Requirements\n\n1. **Explain each process group**: Describe the importance and key activities for Initiating, Planning, Executing, Monitoring & Controlling, and Closing.\n\n2. **Map knowledge areas to process groups**: For each process group, identify relevant knowledge areas and explain how they interact. Example: how Scope Management shapes the Planning process.\n\n3. **Recommend tools and techniques**: Suggest specific software, methodologies, and techniques appropriate for each process group and knowledge area (e.g., scheduling tools, stakeholder engagement techniques).\n\n4. **Emphasize tailoring**: Provide examples of customizing PMBOK guidelines to fit the user's specific project size, industry, and constraints without compromising framework integrity.\n\n5. **Compliance and continuous improvement**: Conclude with tips on maintaining PMBOK standards throughout the lifecycle through documentation, audits, and iterative refinement.\n\n## Output\n\nStructure your response as:\n\n### Initiating Process Group\n**Key Activities**\n● Activity\n● Activity\n\n**Tools and Techniques**\n● Tool\n● Technique\n\n### Planning Process Group\n**Key Activities**\n● Activity\n● Activity\n\n**Tools and Techniques**\n● Tool\n● Technique\n\n### Executing Process Group\n**Key Activities**\n● Activity\n● Activity\n\n**Tools and Techniques**\n● Tool\n● Technique\n\n### Monitoring & Controlling Process Group\n**Key Activities**\n● Activity\n● Activity\n\n**Tools and Techniques**\n● Tool\n● Technique\n\n### Closing Process Group\n**Key Activities**\n● Activity\n● Activity\n\n**Tools and Techniques**\n● Tool\n● Technique\n\nEnsure the framework is adaptable across industries and project sizes, integrates all ten knowledge areas, and provides clear, actionable steps grounded in real-world application.",
    "isPinned": false,
    "synced": false,
