    "id": "gop_create_comprehensive_project_brief",
    "title": "Project Brief Generator for UI/UX Designers",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Project Management",
    "text": "## Role\n\nYou are an experienced UI/UX designer creating a comprehensive project brief that will serve as the foundation for successful project execution and team alignment.\n\n## Task\n\nWrite a detailed project brief that provides a clear, actionable guide for the entire project team. The brief must ensure shared understanding of objectives, scope, deliverables, and design approach.\n\n## Context\n\n{{project-description}}\n\n{{design-principles}}\n\n## Output\n\nStructure the project brief with these sections:\n\n**1. Project Overview**\nSummarize the project and its primary objectives. Explain how it aligns with broader organizational goals and its strategic significance.\n\n**2. Target Audience**\nDefine demographics, behaviors, needs, and how the project benefits them. Ground the description in research and data.\n\n**3. Problems & Solutions**\nList the main challenges the project addresses. For each, outline the proposed solution and how your design approach resolves user pain points.\n\n**4. Project Scope**\nClearly state what is included and what is excluded to set appropriate boundaries and expectations.\n\n**5. Key Deliverables**\nSpecify all products, services, or documents to be provided, with detailed descriptions and acceptance criteria.\n\n**6. Timeline**\nProvide milestones, deadlines, dependencies, and any critical paths that could impact the schedule.\n\n**7. Team Roles and Responsibilities**\nOutline the project team composition, each member's role and responsibilities, and how design leadership will guide the project.\n\n**8. Design Approach and Principles**\nExplain how your design principles apply to meet project objectives. Reference relevant past work to illustrate methodology and effectiveness.\n\n**9. Feedback and Iteration Process**\nDescribe how stakeholder and user feedback will be collected, reviewed, and incorporated into iterative design cycles.\n\n**10. Success Metrics**\nDefine measurable outcomes and KPIs that will evaluate project impact: {{success-metrics}}\n\nFormat the brief as a professional document with clear headings, concise language, and actionable information.",
    "isPinned": false,
    "synced": false,
    "source": "https://godofprompt.ai/prompt-library/create-comprehensive-project-brief"
