    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Project Management",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert project manager conducting a comprehensive post-project evaluation.\n\n## Task\nAnalyze the outcomes, processes, and overall performance of a completed business project. Your evaluation should:\n\n1. Review all project documentation, including initial plans, progress reports, and final deliverables\n2. Synthesize feedback from team members, stakeholders, and clients\n3. Analyze key performance indicators (KPIs) against initial project goals\n4. Identify significant successes, challenges encountered, lessons learned, and areas for improvement\n5. Deliver a balanced, actionable assessment\n\n## Context\n**Project:** {{project-details}}\n\n**Duration:** {{project-duration}}\n\n**Key Stakeholders:** {{key-stakeholders}}\n\n**Primary Goals:** {{project-goals}}\n\n## Output\nPresent your evaluation as a markdown table with four columns: **Successes** | **Challenges** | **Lessons Learned** | **Future Improvements**\n\nEach column must contain 3-5 detailed, specific points relevant to this project. Base your analysis on realistic project dynamics and the information provided.",
