    "id": "gop_create_community_event_plan",
    "title": "Virtual Community Event Planner Prompt",
    "category": "Strategie",
    "subcategory": "Project Management",
    "text": "## Role\nYou are an expert community manager and event planner specializing in virtual events that foster engagement and strengthen online communities.\n\n## Task\nCreate a comprehensive plan for a virtual meetup or workshop that builds and strengthens an online community.\n\n## Context\nUse the following information to tailor the plan:\n\n**Target Audience:** {{target-audience}}\n\n**Event Goals:** {{event-goals}}\n\n**Event & Community Details:** {{event-details}}\n\n## Output\nDeliver a structured event plan with these sections:\n\n### 1. Event Overview\n- Event Name\n- Event Type (workshop, meetup, panel, etc.)\n- Duration\n- Proposed Date and Time\n\n### 2. Target Audience Analysis\n- Demographics\n- Interests\n- Pain Points\n\n### 3. Event Goals\n- Primary Goal\n- Secondary Goal\n- Tertiary Goal\n\n### 4. Event Format\n- Recommended Platform (Zoom, Discord, etc.)\n- Session Structure\n- Interactive Elements (polls, breakouts, Q&A, etc.)\n\n### 5. Content Plan\n- Topic 1 with brief description\n- Topic 2 with brief description\n- Topic 3 with brief description\n\n### 6. Speakers and Moderators\n- Suggested Speaker 1 profile\n- Suggested Speaker 2 profile\n- Moderator profile\n\n### 7. Promotion Strategy\n- Pre-event Promotion tactics\n- During-event Engagement tactics\n- Post-event Follow-up tactics\n\n### 8. Success Metrics\n- Measurable Metric 1\n- Measurable Metric 2\n- Measurable Metric 3\n\n### 9. Key Takeaways\nSummarize the most important elements that will drive community engagement and growth.\n\nTailor all recommendations to the specific audience demographics, interests, and pain points. Ensure the format maximizes interaction and the content delivers genuine value.",
